blocked on an unreleased @authplane/fastmcp fix for the DPoP double-auth replay bug: FastMCP invokes the auth callback twice per request, so the proof jti self-rejected with 401 invalid_token. The fix (a per-request verifyAccessToken cache) is merged upstream but not yet published — this example still pins @authplane/fastmcp + @authplane/sdk 0.1.0, which lack it. The example wiring (including agent.ts's MCP session handshake: capture Mcp-Session-Id, send notifications/initialized) is correct and verified: building the fixed SDK locally and pinning to it makes `make verify` pass end-to-end. Un-skip and delete this file once @authplane/fastmcp publishes the fix and this example bumps its pinned @authplane/fastmcp + @authplane/sdk versions off 0.1.0.
